  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "2499ED72E62662F9",
      "title": "I · A First Spark",
      "description": [
        "Welcome to Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks 3.16.3. This chapter teaches the version actually installed in Ashen Oath, from a Flimsy Journal to researched Eldritch magic. All classes can use magic; Mage is the dedicated spell specialist.",
        "Follow the left lane for early equipment, the middle section for crafting and specialization, and the right section for advanced equipment, bosses and research. Side branches are reference lessons, not a requirement to collect every school.",
        "At Minecraft XP level 10, Ashen grants a once-per-class core spellbook: Mage gets Magic Missile I. Equip it rather than casting loose scrolls away. Additional spells come from exploration or the Scroll Forge.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "578E81611C255BF3",
          "type": "checkmark"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "65F0FD63DB27F787",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 3
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:copper_spell_book",
      "size": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "760387861CE76416",
      "title": "A Book Worth Keeping",
      "description": [
        "Obtain a Flimsy Journal. This is the copper spellbook, not a lore-only notebook: its spell container is what stores reusable spells.",
        "The Mage starter kit supplies this book, a Graybeard Staff, 3 bread and 4 torches. Each class kit is claimable once. Changing class later does not repeatedly generate the same kit.",
        "Hover the journal and inspect its available slots and any inscribed spell. An empty book is a container waiting for inscription; its name alone does not mean it already contains a spell.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 4.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "7C11464A08603334",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "irons_spellbooks:copper_spell_book",
          "count": 1,
          "consume_items": false,
          "only_from_crafting": false,
          "match_nbt": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "1E0325BB2B9280F9",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "2499ED72E62662F9"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:copper_spell_book"
    },
    {
      "id": "38398EF0AF471C80",
      "title": "The Graybeard's First Staff",
      "description": [
        "Obtain the Graybeard Staff from Iron's Spells. It is the intended Mage starter weapon; Weapons of Miracles' Wooden Staff is a different item with a different purpose.",
        "To replace one yourself, craft a wooden shovel with an iron ingot and Arcane Essence in the diagonal recipe shown by JEI. Holding a staff does not replace the need to equip a spellbook.",
        "Read its equipped attributes and compare spell power with the staff held and put away. Keep a melee option while mana recovers, and use a safe training target to learn your reach.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 5.0,
      "y": 4.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "7FE0EA22CDD75A71",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "irons_spellbooks:graybeard_staff",
          "count": 1,
          "consume_items": false,
          "only_from_crafting": false,
          "match_nbt": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "1DF56A3B8D98DB0F",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "760387861CE76416"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:graybeard_staff"
    },
    {
      "id": "79F5B0352DACA10B",
      "title": "Equip the Spellbook Curio",
      "description": [
        "Open your inventory's Curios equipment panel and place the journal in the Spellbook slot. Keeping it in an ordinary inventory slot is not the same as equipping it.",
        "If you received the level-10 Magic Missile reward, equip that inscribed book. Its spell should appear in the spell wheel. An empty journal needs a scroll and the Inscription Table first.",
        "This lesson uses Iron's own equip-spellbook advancement. If you already earned it, existing advancement progress can satisfy the task; otherwise equip a book now."
      ],
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 8.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "1FA9FF41A69774C0",
          "type": "advancement",
          "advancement": "irons_spellbooks:irons_spellbooks/spell_book_equip",
          "criterion": ""
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "60044D806152C65D",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "760387861CE76416"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:copper_spell_book"
    },
    {
      "id": "2F4E678A38FFCD98",
      "title": "Your Actual Casting Controls",
      "description": [
        "Open Options > Controls and search for Iron's Spells. Identify Cast, Spell Selection/Wheel, spell scrolling and any direct spell-slot binds. Use the bindings you configured rather than assuming an internet guide's default keys.",
        "Select a spell from your equipped book, release the selection screen and cast toward a safe target. Test casting in Epic Fight battle stance too: this pack includes casting compatibility, so you can weave spells into combat.",
        "Ashen passive abilities have their own binds and cooldown indicators. Blink or Windrunner is not the same system as selecting and casting an Iron's spell, even when the effects look similar.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 5.0,
      "y": 8.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "7598665A6F0A2083",
          "type": "checkmark"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "56A98CA7F7E04EC3",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "79F5B0352DACA10B"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:scroll"
    },
    {
      "id": "28A098890C8585BF",
      "title": "Instant, Charged and Recast Spells",
      "description": [
        "Read the cast type, mana cost, cast time and cooldown on a spell's tooltip. Instant spells resolve immediately; longer casts commit you to an animation, while continuous spells spend time maintaining an effect.",
        "Some spells grant recasts: follow-up activations belong to the original spell sequence. Watch their on-screen state and remaining recast opportunities rather than treating every press as an unrelated new cast.",
        "Practice one low-cost spell first. Move behind cover before a long cast, avoid interrupting yourself with another action, and verify whether the spell targets an entity, a block, a direction or an area.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 10.0,
      "y": 8.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "135B03E274FE847A",
          "type": "checkmark"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "5F04B46CA65AE681",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "2F4E678A38FFCD98"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:scroll"
    },
    {
      "id": "4534E624EDD42AEA",
      "title": "Loot a Scroll, Read Before Using",
      "description": [
        "Find a scroll in dungeon loot or from magical enemies. Dedicated magic structures are useful places to search, but enter with food, an escape route and spare inventory space.",
        "Inspect its spell name, school, level, mana cost and cooldown. A loose scroll is a consumable casting item; to keep using its spell, take it to an Inscription Table and inscribe a spellbook.",
        "Keep your only useful scroll for inscription instead of spending it in a test cast. Eldritch scrolls can be unlearned and scrambled; their research requirement is explained in the late-game branch.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 5.0,
      "y": 12.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "75FEE650E7EF01A7",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "irons_spellbooks:scroll",
          "count": 1,
          "consume_items": false,
          "only_from_crafting": false,
          "match_nbt": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "0CBF9750FBACC71C",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "760387861CE76416"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:scroll"
    },
    {
      "id": "4BDE7B3D26E7AF9D",
      "title": "Build an Inscription Table",
      "description": [
        "Craft and place an Inscription Table. Its inexpensive recipe uses a book, wooden slabs and a fence; JEI shows the arrangement for this pack.",
        "Open the table with your spellbook available. Use its spellbook/scroll slots to move a spell from a scroll into an unlocked book slot, then take the book back and equip it in Curios.",
        "Do not confuse this workstation with the Scroll Forge. Inscription manages the spells you already possess; forging creates new scrolls from materials.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 12.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5AEBDB6C854A63F2",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "irons_spellbooks:inscription_table",
          "count": 1,
          "consume_items": false,
          "only_from_crafting": false,
          "match_nbt": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "6757BD793B354A34",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 3
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "79F5B0352DACA10B"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:inscription_table"
    },
    {
      "id": "77B05289852320F8",
      "title": "Inscribe, Remove and Rearrange",
      "description": [
        "Inscribe one useful offensive spell. Equip the book, select the spell and cast it. Then return to the table and practice removing or moving an unlocked spell without throwing away its scroll.",
        "Build a small library chest for spare scrolls. Keep school and spell level organized so you can retrieve a healing or mobility tool before a dangerous trip.",
        "Locked spells in unique books are different: they are part of the item and cannot simply be removed like an ordinary unlocked slot. Their dedicated upgrade path appears later in this chapter.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 10.0,
      "y": 12.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "58375BBBB29F4BA8",
          "type": "checkmark"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "6B5A8A779D229ECB",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "4BDE7B3D26E7AF9D",
        "4534E624EDD42AEA"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:scroll"
    },
    {
      "id": "3FE6CAC54C85CA00",
      "title": "Mana Is Your Combat Rhythm",
      "description": [
        "Cast your inexpensive spell until you understand its cost, then stop and watch mana refill. Ashen keeps the mana bar visible even at full mana, so compare both current and maximum values.",
        "Maximum mana determines your reserve. Mana regeneration determines how long you can sustain a rotation. Spell power strengthens supported spell effects, while cast-time reduction and cooldown reduction solve different delays.",
        "Practice alternating a spell, movement or a melee attack, then another spell. Enter a difficult fight with enough mana for your escape or defensive spell; spending everything on an opener leaves no recovery tool.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 16.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "131533A7DFC249F8",
          "type": "checkmark"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "285C3B41C01ED340",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 3
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "4BDE7B3D26E7AF9D",
        "2F4E678A38FFCD98"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:mana_ring"
    },
    {
      "id": "7F0E8CA5023FA045",
      "title": "Start an Arcane Material Reserve",
      "description": [
        "Collect 8 Arcane Essence from exploration or magic-related loot. Save a reserve rather than spending every piece on the first recipe you unlock.",
        "Essence is used throughout the mod: staff crafting, Arcane Cloth, Arcane Ingots and many later recipes. Use JEI's Uses view on the item to see which upgrades compete for the same stock.",
        "Separate supplies into essence, inks, school focuses, runestones and equipment. This makes your next crafting step clear and prevents accidentally recycling a valuable scroll.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 5.0,
      "y": 16.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "1A6439181EBB291E",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "irons_spellbooks:arcane_essence",
          "count": 8,
