      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:arcane_essence"
    },
    {
      "id": "1CC00F8769EA2BD2",
      "title": "A Wandering Magician's Robe",
      "description": [
        "Obtain a Wandering Magician Robe and compare its mana attributes with your current chestplate. Magic equipment trades some benefits against conventional armor, so read the whole tooltip before equipping it.",
        "Keep enough physical protection to survive ordinary enemies. A larger mana pool does not prevent melee hits, and spellcasters still benefit from positioning, Guard and an emergency escape.",
        "Try the robe in an easy encounter and compare how many casts your equipment supports. The later school-armor branch will help specialize those general casting bonuses.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 10.0,
      "y": 16.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "54B1CA61515C13FE",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "irons_spellbooks:wandering_magician_chestplate",
          "count": 1,
          "consume_items": false,
          "only_from_crafting": false,
          "match_nbt": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "2D8C6553E800A822",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 1
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "7F0E8CA5023FA045"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:wandering_magician_chestplate"
    },
    {
      "id": "2A17B195856FA837",
      "title": "Common Ink, First Rarity",
      "description": [
        "Collect Common Ink. Scroll crafting uses ink rarity to select a spell's available rarity bracket; rarity and numerical spell level are related, but they are not interchangeable names.",
        "Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic and Legendary are the five ink tiers. A spell whose minimum rarity is higher cannot be forged with lower ink just because you own its school focus.",
        "Store bottles by tier. You will soon convert lower tiers upward, but it takes multiple bottles of lower ink to obtain one bottle of the next tier.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 20.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5C3A8EB8B30FC487",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "irons_spellbooks:common_ink",
          "count": 1,
          "consume_items": false,
          "only_from_crafting": false,
          "match_nbt": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "id": "7C4199F01A72D56B",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "minecraft:experience_bottle",
          "count": 3
        }
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "7F0E8CA5023FA045"
      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:common_ink"
    },
    {
      "id": "1F1DC232CE947F75",
      "title": "Build the Alchemist Cauldron",
      "description": [
        "Craft an Alchemist Cauldron, place it in your workshop and inspect its JEI recipe categories. This is Iron's workstation, not a normal vanilla cauldron.",
        "The cauldron handles fluid inputs and outputs, ink conversion, scroll recycling and alchemy. Insert the required fluid and ingredient, then use the appropriate container to withdraw the result.",
        "Keep glass bottles beside it. Check the exact recipe before adding ingredients: different recipes require different starting fluids, amounts and item catalysts.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 5.0,
      "y": 20.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "3446545880932560",
          "type": "item",
          "item": "irons_spellbooks:alchemist_cauldron",
          "count": 1,
