      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:scroll"
    },
    {
      "id": "1F1B85FD327FF630",
      "title": "Upgrade Ink: Copper",
      "description": [
        "Produce or find Uncommon Ink. The installed cauldron recipe converts 1000 mB of Common Ink with a copper ingot into 250 mB of Uncommon Ink.",
        "That is four 250 mB bottles of the lower ink for one bottle of the higher ink. Read the fluid gauges and collect the output so you do not mistake concentrated ink for lost fluid.",
        "This is the first repeatable way to turn common exploration loot into a more useful crafting tier. Higher conversions use iron, gold and amethyst in later lessons.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 5.0,
      "y": 24.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "0F0A5BAEC40D1FEB",
          "type": "item",
