    },
    {
      "id": "6CB9122BF591A7C4",
      "title": "Early Game · A Working Caster",
      "description": [
        "Prepare an equipped spellbook with a spell you can cast repeatedly, a staff or backup weapon, food and an escape plan. Take that loadout through a small hostile encounter outside your base.",
        "Practice selecting the spell, spending mana, switching to movement or melee and returning to casting. Retreat before you run out of both health and mana.",
        "You now have a repeatable early-game loop: explore for scrolls and essence, inscribe useful spells, recycle surplus and upgrade ink. The next section replaces random spell discovery with deliberate crafting.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 0.0,
      "y": 28.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "5E6B31068E40C8F1",
          "type": "checkmark"
        }
      ],
