      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:graybeard_staff",
      "size": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "11180DABC0E23FFB",
      "title": "II · Craft a Scroll Forge",
      "description": [
        "Craft and place the Scroll Forge using polished deepslate and crying obsidian. You can collect crying obsidian from exploration or Nether-related trading; this recipe is the actual one in 3.16.3.",
        "The forge creates spell scrolls using paper, ink and a school focus. The school focus chooses the spell family; the ink rarity controls which spell levels are offered.",
        "Browse before spending materials. A disabled or unavailable spell is not unlocked by repeatedly pressing craft, and Eldritch spells have an additional research requirement.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 22.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "72338F5394DB95AA",
