    },
    {
      "id": "64629BDF08A3903C",
      "title": "Forge a Spell You Actually Want",
      "description": [
        "Choose a spell whose minimum rarity fits your available ink. Insert paper, the matching focus and ink, select the desired spell in the forge and craft its scroll.",
        "The forged level starts at the lowest level in that rarity bracket. To raise it further, use the Arcane Anvil lesson below rather than assuming every Legendary scroll is maximum level.",
        "Take the finished scroll to the Inscription Table, add it to your book, re-equip the book and verify it appears in your wheel. Crafting the scroll is only one part of making the spell usable.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 22.0,
      "y": 4.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
