      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:scroll"
    },
    {
      "id": "6E4D814DAC21AEF4",
      "title": "Eight Schools, One Deliberate Build",
      "description": [
        "The ordinary schools are Evocation, Fire, Ice, Lightning, Holy, Blood, Ender and Nature. Eldritch is a separate advanced research branch.",
        "The eight lessons to the right identify each focus and give a practical reason to try that school. You do not have to gather every focus before continuing the central progression.",
        "Choose a primary damage school, one defensive or healing spell and one movement or utility spell. Compare a spell's actual mana and cooldown against your equipment instead of equipping only expensive attacks.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 27.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "0CB37AF2F84A0A99",
