      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:blank_rune"
    },
    {
      "id": "78DA39729338B8F7",
      "title": "School · Evocation",
      "description": [
        "Evocation uses emeralds as its school focus. Start with Magic Missile for a straightforward ranged attack and explore fang spells or summons when you can support their mana cost.",
        "The Mage level-10 core book already demonstrates Magic Missile. Spell levels and Evocation power can improve it, but allocating a passive ability in Ashen's tree is a separate action from leveling the inscribed spell.",
        "Use this focus in the Scroll Forge and inspect the offered spells. This focus collection task is a reference milestone, not a demand to use this school permanently.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 37.0,
      "y": 0.0,
      "tasks": [
