      "icon": "minecraft:emerald"
    },
    {
      "id": "1C77D78966795BF2",
      "title": "School · Fire",
      "description": [
        "Fire uses blaze rods as its school focus. Firebolt offers a simple ranged tool; Fireball, persistent flames and other Fire spells serve different area and damage roles.",
        "Test fire against an ordinary vulnerable enemy before committing to a Fire-only boss loadout. Fire-resistant enemies can change your results dramatically; keep an alternative school available.",
        "Use this focus in the Scroll Forge and inspect the offered spells. This focus collection task is a reference milestone, not a demand to use this school permanently.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 37.0,
      "y": 4.0,
      "tasks": [
