    },
    {
      "id": "7F6209A297C756A3",
      "title": "School · Ice",
      "description": [
        "Ice uses Frozen Bones, which can drop from strays. Prepare for cold biomes and ranged enemies while collecting your first focus.",
        "Compare a projectile such as Icicle with slowing or area-control spells. Crowd control helps you create space for long casts, but a boss may respond differently from an ordinary enemy.",
        "Use this focus in the Scroll Forge and inspect the offered spells. This focus collection task is a reference milestone, not a demand to use this school permanently.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 37.0,
      "y": 8.0,
