    },
    {
      "id": "6134522CADC358C0",
      "title": "School · Lightning",
      "description": [
        "Lightning uses Bottle o' Lightning. Use an empty glass bottle on a charged creeper; charging and approaching the creeper is dangerous, so arrange cover and an escape route first.",
        "Lightning Lance, Chain Lightning and persistent Lightning effects have different targeting and timing. Compare damage against the same target and include cast time and cooldown in your judgement.",
        "Use this focus in the Scroll Forge and inspect the offered spells. This focus collection task is a reference milestone, not a demand to use this school permanently.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 37.0,
      "y": 12.0,
      "tasks": [
