    {
      "id": "1057862EF46DA271",
      "title": "School · Holy",
      "description": [
        "Holy uses Divine Pearls. Craft them using the gold and amethyst recipe shown in JEI rather than waiting for a particular random chest.",
        "Try a healing option as well as an offensive spell such as Guiding Bolt or Sunbeam. Healing, channelled or persistent damage and support all compete for the same mana reserve.",
        "Use this focus in the Scroll Forge and inspect the offered spells. This focus collection task is a reference milestone, not a demand to use this school permanently.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
