    {
      "id": "1F10EE7E444A9D29",
      "title": "School · Blood",
      "description": [
        "Blood uses Blood Vials. Their item guide describes collecting blood from creatures placed into a heated vanilla cauldron or through the Alchemist Cauldron system; follow JEI for the fluid and bottle steps.",
        "Explore Blood Slash, Blood Needles, Acupuncture or a recovery-oriented spell. Inspect targeting and projectile counts carefully: a listed number may be damage per projectile rather than the total of the whole cast.",
        "Use this focus in the Scroll Forge and inspect the offered spells. This focus collection task is a reference milestone, not a demand to use this school permanently.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
