    {
      "id": "7F0791D342126FE0",
      "title": "School · Ender",
      "description": [
        "Ender uses ender pearls. Save a reserve for travel and crafting instead of spending every pearl on scrolls.",
        "Teleport, Portal, Black Hole and related spells provide movement, control or damage. Ashen's passive Blink is its own ability; changing an Iron's Teleport scroll does not change the passive's range or cooldown.",
        "Use this focus in the Scroll Forge and inspect the offered spells. This focus collection task is a reference milestone, not a demand to use this school permanently.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 37.0,
      "y": 24.0,
