    },
    {
      "id": "55B2800C20768E96",
      "title": "School · Nature",
      "description": [
        "Nature uses poisonous potatoes. Harvest and replant potatoes until you obtain one, or keep any you find while exploring.",
        "Try poison, roots or defensive Nature magic. Iron's poison spells and Ashen Rogue's custom stackable poison have different implementations; do not assume every Nature cast creates Rogue poison stacks.",
        "Use this focus in the Scroll Forge and inspect the offered spells. This focus collection task is a reference milestone, not a demand to use this school permanently.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 37.0,
      "y": 28.0,
