      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:arcane_anvil"
    },
    {
      "id": "0EFBC5B205BC9EBB",
      "title": "Level a Scroll with the Correct Ink",
      "description": [
        "Place a scroll on the Arcane Anvil's left input and ink on the right. The ink must match the rarity of the scroll's NEXT level; the same rarity can cover several consecutive numerical levels.",
        "Taking the valid result raises the scroll exactly one level. Repeat with the correct ink until the desired level or the spell's maximum, then inscribe the upgraded scroll back into your spellbook.",
        "This build upgrades ordinary scrolls with ink. Do not follow older instructions that say to combine two identical scrolls, and do not expect the anvil to directly level every spell already inside an ordinary book.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 27.0,
      "y": 8.0,
      "tasks": [
