    },
    {
      "id": "69D8664D74C6073B",
      "title": "An Ironbound Tome",
      "description": [
        "Craft an Ironbound Tome from its chain, leather and paper recipe. Compare its capacity and attributes with the Flimsy Journal before moving your spells.",
        "Transfer useful unlocked spells at the Inscription Table and equip the new book. Keep the old book until you have confirmed that your intended loadout appears in the spell wheel.",
        "Spellbook tiers offer different capacities and bonuses. In this installed version, do not assume the book's material imposes an old guide's maximum spell-rarity cap; inspect its real slot information.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 27.0,
      "y": 4.0,
      "tasks": [
