    },
    {
      "id": "3FDADB7549C630DF",
      "title": "The Apprentice's Spell Book",
      "description": [
        "Craft an Apprentice's Spell Book using gold, Arcane Essence and Hogskin. Hoglins supply Hogskin, so plan a protected Nether trip rather than treating this as a purely Overworld shopping list.",
        "Use the Inscription Table to transfer your selected spells. Fill the new capacity deliberately: a cheap repeatable attack, survival tool and utility option are more useful than several expensive attacks with the same role.",
        "Store spare scrolls and record which spells you actually use. Your next upgrade should address a real limit such as mana, slots or survivability.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 32.0,
      "y": 4.0,
      "tasks": [
