    },
    {
      "id": "57952A14C10A5474",
      "title": "Upgrade Ink: Iron",
      "description": [
        "Produce or find Rare Ink. The cauldron recipe uses 1000 mB of Uncommon Ink and an iron ingot to yield 250 mB of Rare Ink.",
        "Use this tier for spells or next-level upgrades that call for Rare rarity. A high-level spell from another school still needs that school's matching focus when you forge a fresh scroll.",
        "Reserve enough ink for the next few scroll upgrades before spending it on experiments. Upgrading into Epic later requires another four-to-one fluid conversion.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 27.0,
      "y": 12.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "7F916CA4B425B356",
          "type": "item",
