    },
    {
      "id": "42B27B2A00A41717",
      "title": "Upgrade Ink: Gold",
      "description": [
        "Produce or find Epic Ink. Convert 1000 mB of Rare Ink with a gold ingot into 250 mB of Epic Ink at the Alchemist Cauldron.",
        "Compare the spells unlocked at this tier with the stronger levels of your existing spells. Better rarity can be an opportunity to improve a familiar low-cost rotation rather than replacing your whole build.",
        "Inspect the next-level requirement at the Arcane Anvil before committing the ink. A scroll already at its maximum level will not gain a valid upgrade result.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 32.0,
      "y": 12.0,
      "tasks": [
