    },
    {
      "id": "1B62B6FCC306701B",
      "title": "Weave Arcane Cloth",
      "description": [
        "Craft Arcane Cloth from the magic-essence and wool recipe shown in JEI. This cloth feeds spellbooks, robes and later equipment recipes, so produce more than the single proof item.",
        "Use JEI's Uses view to compare a larger spellbook with the armor upgrade you want. Store the rest with your essence reserve.",
        "Materials progress independently of your class selection. A Warrior can craft magic equipment, while a Mage still needs to obtain the same crafting ingredients as everyone else.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
