    {
      "id": "4E3DC5B88F153D94",
      "title": "Runestones and School Specialization",
      "description": [
        "Obtain a Blank Runestone from magical loot or enemies. Inspect its uses: school runes and stat-related runes feed specialized armor and upgrade recipes.",
        "Choose the rune that matches your intended equipment. A school focus chooses forgeable spells; a rune is a crafting material. They are related to the same school but do not replace one another in recipes.",
        "Keep one spare runestone while comparing recipes. Do not convert all your blanks before deciding whether you want school power, recovery, protection or a different crafting branch.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 32.0,
      "y": 16.0,
      "tasks": [
