    {
      "id": "11657A342CBEC882",
      "title": "Dress for Your Chosen School",
      "description": [
        "Choose a school armor line such as Pyromancer, Cryomancer, Electromancer, Archevoker, Priest, Cultist, Shadow-Walker or Plagued. Inspect the individual piece recipes and resulting attributes in JEI.",
        "Craft and equip at least one piece that supports your chosen school, then compare mana and spell damage with your previous armor. A full set is a goal, not an excuse to ignore physical protection.",
        "School-specific spell power helps its matching school, whereas general spell power supports a broader loadout. Read each tooltip and compare a real cast on the same target before committing to a full set.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 22.0,
      "y": 12.0,
