    {
      "id": "276A5E6397B4FB90",
      "title": "The Enchanted Spell Book",
      "description": [
        "Craft the Enchanted Spell Book using diamonds, Arcane Cloth, Hogskin and an enchanted book. Check JEI for the full arrangement and keep your current spellbook safe during crafting.",
        "Move unlocked spells through the Inscription Table and verify the new book's capacity and attributes. More slots let you carry answers to different encounters rather than forcing one damage school everywhere.",
        "Build a loadout with damage, defense, recovery and mobility. Keep a spare slot for experimenting with a newly forged scroll.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
