    {
      "id": "1175678F96BF15BE",
      "title": "Add a Spell Slot",
      "description": [
        "Craft a Lesser Spell Slot Improvement from Hogskin and Arcane Cloth. Put the spellbook on the Arcane Anvil's left and the improvement on the right.",
        "Taking a valid result adds one slot only while the book remains below that improvement's stated slot limit. It is not an unlimited expansion item; a book already at or above the cap has no valid result.",
        "Re-equip the improved book and verify its capacity. Plan upgrades around the number of spells you actually switch between during a fight.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
