    {
      "id": "3E810453CB4438CE",
      "title": "Rings: Reserve, Recovery or Speed",
      "description": [
        "Inspect Rings of Mana, Recovery and Expediency in JEI and in their tooltips. Obtain and equip a useful magic curio in the correct Curios slot.",
        "Maximum mana, spell cooldown and cast time are separate constraints. Choose a ring that fixes your rotation's weakness rather than automatically equipping the rarest-looking icon.",
        "Some protective rings address a specific hazard. Read the actual immunity or effect before entering a dangerous structure, and avoid relying on a bonus from an item that is only sitting in your inventory.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 32.0,
      "y": 20.0,
