    {
      "id": "06346422D1C5C0F6",
      "title": "Mithril for Advanced Tools",
      "description": [
        "Obtain Mithril Scrap from the sources shown in JEI. In this version, ore processing and blasting Arcane Salvage are relevant routes; four scraps also assemble into one Mithril Ingot.",
        "Keep a reserve for affinity rings and later equipment instead of converting every piece immediately. Some recipes use scraps and others use the ingot.",
        "Search JEI's Uses view for both forms and select a next project. You do not have to complete every late-game mining or boss branch before you can evaluate these recipes.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
