    {
      "id": "6DBD539051827C12",
      "title": "Attune a Ring to One Spell",
      "description": [
        "Craft an Affinity Ring with the bucket and Mithril Scrap recipe. At the Arcane Anvil, combine the ring on the left with a scroll of the spell you want to favor on the right.",
        "Inspect the attuned result and equip it in Curios. Affinity targets that chosen spell; it is not a universal spell-power upgrade for your entire book.",
        "Compare the selected spell's effective tooltip and performance with the ring equipped. Use a cheap copy of the relevant scroll for attunement and keep your primary inscribed spell safe.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 27.0,
