    {
      "id": "50DDA01681427F58",
      "title": "Imbue Compatible Equipment",
      "description": [
        "Find a compatible piece of equipment using JEI's Arcane Anvil recipes, then place it on the left and a spell scroll on the right. Read the output before taking it; not every weapon or armor piece accepts imbuement.",
        "This version supports more than weapon-only casting, including compatible armor and Curios items. Equip the result and look for its spell in the wheel or configured casting controls.",
        "The server has mana consumption enabled for imbued weapons. Imbuement does not grant free casts, and older instructions to right-click every imbued sword may not match this version's casting system.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
