    {
      "id": "54D4B43F8F693A5F",
      "title": "Remove an Upgrade Deliberately",
      "description": [
        "Craft a Shriving Stone and inspect its uses. In this installed version, use it in the Arcane Anvil with the equipment being cleaned; do not follow an older Smithing Table instruction.",
        "Read the result and any returned upgrade materials before taking it. Shriving can remove equipment imbuement or upgrades; removing a normal unlocked spell from a book belongs at the Inscription Table instead.",
        "Try the process with replaceable equipment before touching your best item. The output preview is your check that the intended operation is happening.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
