    {
      "id": "137A8DA128C0C9B2",
      "title": "Brew an Elixir Loadout",
      "description": [
        "Inspect the Alchemist Cauldron recipes for Oakskin, Evasion and Invisibility elixirs, including stronger variants. Some begin from a specific potion fluid rather than plain water or ink.",
        "Prepare the exact base fluid, catalyst and bottle specified by JEI. Read the bottled result's duration and effect before a dangerous trip.",
        "Practice using one defensive elixir before combat and keep an emergency option ready. These are consumables, not permanent passive-tree bonuses, and their names do not guarantee the same mechanics as Ashen's custom abilities.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
