    {
      "id": "6BDA0A827E12C9B2",
      "title": "Mid Game · Your Own Spellcraft",
      "description": [
        "Take a deliberately built loadout into a magical structure: a forged and leveled attack, a survival tool, a usable mana reserve and equipment that supports your chosen school.",
        "Compare sustained damage against burst damage on the training dummy. Include cast time, cooldown and mana recovery rather than comparing only the largest floating number from one hit.",
        "You should now be able to replace a lost scroll, upgrade its level, move spells between books and choose equipment for a purpose. The final section focuses on high-tier materials, bosses and researched magic.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
