    {
      "id": "1BC56DB6AA526AC4",
      "title": "III · Legendary Ink",
      "description": [
        "Obtain Legendary Ink. The cauldron recipe turns 1000 mB of Epic Ink plus an amethyst shard into 250 mB of Legendary Ink.",
        "Use it for spells whose next level requires Legendary rarity. Legendary is a rarity bracket, not a promise that every spell made with it is automatically at maximum numerical level.",
        "Set a budget before upgrading several spells. Keep a reliable cheap rotation available while expensive high-tier spells recover their cooldowns.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 54.0,
      "y": 0.0,
