    {
      "id": "472C671EE8558F68",
      "title": "Arcane Debris and Arcane Salvage",
      "description": [
        "Find Arcane Debris in deep Overworld mining and check its required mining tier before breaking it. Bring a suitable pickaxe and use JEI to inspect the installed processing recipes.",
        "Process the debris into Arcane Salvage. Salvage can then be blasted into Mithril Scrap in this version, linking deep exploration to your advanced material supply.",
        "Mark a safe route home and carry only the valuables you need. Keep salvage, Mithril and ordinary Ancient Debris in separate storage so you do not confuse their recipes.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
