    {
      "id": "36430C7F13679B38",
      "title": "Ancient Battlegrounds and Cinder",
      "description": [
        "Explore an Ancient Battleground and investigate its Armor Piles with suitable mining equipment. Be ready for an Ancient Knight instead of treating the pile as harmless decoration.",
        "Defeat the threat and obtain Cinder Essence. Cinder feeds advanced recipes and the Soulcaller route, so keep a reserve rather than spending the first pieces immediately.",
        "Learn the knight's attack openings and use terrain, Guard and a defensive spell. You are gathering an endgame resource, not testing whether a cloth robe can absorb every melee hit.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 64.0,
