      "title": "Craft an Empty Upgrade Orb",
      "description": [
        "Craft an Empty Upgrade Orb. The installed recipe uses Arcane Ingots, Cinder Essence and Mithril; inspect JEI instead of following an old recipe that directly consumes Arcane Salvage.",
        "Convert the blank orb into a school-power, mana, recovery or protection orb using its matching recipe. Choose based on the equipment slot and the problem you want to solve.",
        "Empty orbs are ingredients. The useful attribute is supplied by the completed upgrade type and then applied to eligible equipment at the Arcane Anvil.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
