    {
      "id": "5C2988D69C73124B",
      "title": "Spend the Three Upgrade Slots Wisely",
      "description": [
        "Apply a completed upgrade orb to compatible equipment at the Arcane Anvil. Read its output tooltip and verify that the attribute belongs to the slot where you actually equip the item.",
        "This server allows three orb upgrades per eligible equipment item. That total is shared across upgrade types; it is not three upgrades of every school and stat on the same piece.",
        "Decide between more mana, shorter recovery, protection or specialized damage. Test the result and use the Shriving Stone lesson if you later need to revise the item.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
