    {
      "id": "6CCBFA3E9D05FABE",
      "title": "Craft the Ancient Codex",
      "description": [
        "Craft the Ancient Codex, the netherite spellbook. Its installed recipe includes netherite, a Ruined Book, Arcane Cloth, Blood Vials and Bottle o' Lightning.",
        "Ruined Books lead you toward Ancient City exploration. Plan stealth, wool and an escape route for the Deep Dark rather than trying to solve every danger with a loud damage spell.",
        "Transfer your chosen unlocked spells at the Inscription Table and equip the new book. Read capacity and attributes before deciding whether a unique school book might fit your build better.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 59.0,
      "y": 4.0,
