    {
      "id": "55C7D3B3D9B0A4D3",
      "title": "Unique Books, Locked Spells",
      "description": [
        "Compare unique books such as the Necronomicon, Grimoire of Evokation, Druidic Tome, Frostbranded Book and Dragonskin Spell Book. Their routes include crafting and specific exploration or loot sources.",
        "A unique item can have an intrinsic locked spell alongside usable unlocked capacity. Use the Inscription Table for ordinary slots; an intrinsic spell is not removed in the same way.",
        "To improve a matching locked spell in this version, place the unique item on the Arcane Anvil's left and a higher-level scroll of that same spell on the right. Confirm the output before taking it.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 59.0,
