    {
      "id": "18C2FD6828DE2B93",
      "title": "Pyrium and a Specialist Staff",
      "description": [
        "Inspect Pyrium sources and crafting uses in JEI, then work toward a specialist staff such as the Pyrium Staff. Its recipe uses Pyrium, netherite and Arcane Cloth.",
        "Compare its attributes and casting behavior against the Graybeard Staff you began with. A specialist item is an investment in a school or role, not a replacement for the spellbook Curio system.",
        "Keep a second damage school or defensive tool available. A strong Fire build still needs a plan for Fire-resistant encounters.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 64.0,
      "y": 4.0,
      "tasks": [
