    {
      "id": "20E5EE481DD4508C",
      "title": "Netherite Battlemage Equipment",
      "description": [
        "Inspect the Netherite Battlemage armor recipes and progression in JEI. Obtain or craft suitable advanced pieces and compare their physical and magical attributes with your school set.",
        "Check imbuement eligibility and available upgrade slots before investing rare materials. Use school armor when specialization wins and a sturdier mixed loadout when the encounter demands survival.",
        "Enchantment, upgrade orbs, imbuements and Apotheosis affixes are separate systems. Read what each item actually supports; do not assume that every system accepts every armor piece or spellbook.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 64.0,
