    {
      "id": "790D6A98C9339AD3",
      "title": "Find the Catacombs",
      "description": [
        "Craft a Wayward Compass and activate its search if it has not found a destination. It points toward Catacombs, not the Nether's Lost Citadel.",
        "Pack replacement food, blocks, lighting and a way to retreat. Clear lesser enemies and learn the layout before approaching the Dead King's encounter.",
        "This is an Iron's Spells boss route. It does not bypass Ashen Oath's separate Cataclysm story gates or unlock a sealed story boss.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 54.0,
      "y": 12.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
