    },
    {
      "id": "7F8C600594FF7A1F",
      "title": "Defeat the Dead King",
      "description": [
        "Enter the Catacombs with a prepared spell rotation and challenge the Dead King. Save mana for movement or defense and learn attack windows instead of maintaining an uninterrupted damage cast at any cost.",
        "Clear dangerous supporting enemies and keep track of the arena. Use a damage option that works on the target rather than assuming every poison or status effect is equally effective against an undead boss.",
        "After victory, collect the loot and any personal reward drops. Keep unique equipment, crafting materials and keys; the next lesson explains the related vault rewards.",
        "Completion: defeat this enemy after the lesson unlocks. This is a real kill task; summoning or seeing the enemy does not complete it."
      ],
      "x": 54.0,
      "y": 16.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "4CEDF05D5BCF29DB",
          "type": "kill",
          "entity": "irons_spellbooks:dead_king",
