      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:necronomicon_spell_book"
    },
    {
      "id": "177A8D08857F26A7",
      "title": "Keys and Structure Vaults",
      "description": [
        "Inspect the Bone Key obtained through the Dead King route and locate the corresponding Bone Vault in the structure. Use the matching key and check the resulting personal loot.",
        "The mod also has Cinderous keys and vaults tied to its other advanced encounters. Read the key and vault names instead of trying every key on every block.",
        "Vault rewards and ordinary chest loot are different reward paths. Do not assume an already-used vault is a freely repeatable chest; learn its eligibility and matching-key behavior from the actual interaction.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 59.0,
      "y": 16.0,
      "tasks": [
