      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:bone_key"
    },
    {
      "id": "3AE756E3946CA519",
      "title": "Return to the Dead King",
      "description": [
        "Collect Dead King Phylactery Shards through the relevant exploration and loot routes shown in JEI. Eight shards surround a Soul Lantern to craft the completed phylactery.",
        "Use the completed item on the Dead King Soul to bring the encounter back, as its item tooltip instructs. This is a specific resurrection interaction, not a command or an ordinary spawn egg.",
        "Bring a fresh combat supply before repeating the boss. Farming valuable loot still requires defeating the encounter; the questbook does not hand out its unique drops.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 54.0,
      "y": 20.0,
      "tasks": [
