    {
      "id": "2D2C90FC91128D3B",
      "title": "The Lost Citadel Expedition",
      "description": [
        "Search the Nether for the Lost Citadel. Secure a route to and from the structure before taking your best equipment inside, and investigate its rooms and ritual locations methodically.",
        "Secure the approach and defeat the Citadel's defenders carefully. Pack an alternate damage school for enemies that resist your main element and an escape tool that works in the environment.",
        "Do not confuse Iron's Lost Citadel or Echo of Tyros with Cataclysm's Ignis story encounter. Their progression and mechanics are separate even though both are dangerous Nether content.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 64.0,
      "y": 12.0,
      "tasks": [
