    },
    {
      "id": "1AAD21527CC70AC3",
      "title": "Craft the Cinderous Soulcaller",
      "description": [
        "Craft a Cinderous Soulcaller from Cinder Essence, netherite scraps and an echo shard. Keep it for the Citadel ritual rather than treating it as a normal weapon.",
        "Find the Cinderous Soul Rune and use the Soulcaller at the appropriate ritual location. Its feedback distinguishes an unresponsive location from an encounter that is already in progress.",
        "Prepare your armor, mana reserve and healing before activating the ritual. Summoning the boss is a commitment to learning the fight, not the completion condition for the next quest.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 64.0,
      "y": 16.0,
      "tasks": [
