    },
    {
      "id": "56BFAE8ABB158609",
      "title": "Defeat the Echo of Tyros",
      "description": [
        "Complete the Lost Citadel ritual and defeat the Echo of Tyros. The registered enemy type is Iron's fire_boss; it is not the Elder Guardian or another Cataclysm boss.",
        "Observe attack tells, use the arena deliberately and avoid relying on one long cast when a dodge is needed. Try an alternate damage school if your usual attacks are ineffective.",
        "Collect the resulting loot and inspect any keys or unique equipment before leaving. Compare your finished build's damage and survivability with the loadout you used for the Dead King.",
        "Completion: defeat this enemy after the lesson unlocks. This is a real kill task; summoning or seeing the enemy does not complete it."
      ],
      "x": 64.0,
      "y": 20.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "7F4B35F7F13B2D06",
          "type": "kill",
          "entity": "irons_spellbooks:fire_boss",
          "value": 1
