      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:ancient_knowledge_fragment"
    },
    {
      "id": "6A79D7AFDE04C090",
      "title": "Make an Eldritch Manuscript",
      "description": [
        "Craft an Eldritch Manuscript with eight Ancient Knowledge Fragments around one echo shard. Keep additional fragments if you intend to learn several advanced spells.",
        "Use the manuscript to open the Eldritch research screen. The screen shows spell nodes, their relationships and whether you have already learned them.",
        "Owning the manuscript alone does not automatically teach every Eldritch spell. The research action and any prerequisites belong to the selected node.",
        "Completion: carry the requested item in your normal inventory. Detection keeps your items; nothing is submitted or consumed. JEI shows this pack's exact recipes."
      ],
      "x": 74.0,
      "y": 4.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "38E8BD30A15E6C04",
          "type": "item",
