      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:eldritch_manuscript"
    },
    {
      "id": "2B25C46EA232EE69",
      "title": "Research an Eldritch Spell",
      "description": [
        "Open the manuscript research screen, select an available node and read its requirements. Follow the screen's Hold to Learn action; it spends one manuscript for the selected learning action.",
        "Complete any prerequisite nodes the screen requires before attempting a later spell. Check the node's learned state after the action instead of assuming that briefly clicking it completed research.",
        "Research makes a spell learnable or usable through the normal spell systems. You still need an appropriate scroll, crafting materials and a place in your actual equipped loadout.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 74.0,
      "y": 8.0,
      "tasks": [
        {
          "id": "0F4FB7E6BAC62BC6",
          "type": "checkmark"
        }
      ],
