      ],
      "optional": true,
      "hide_until_deps_complete": false,
      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:eldritch_manuscript"
    },
    {
      "id": "751240EDAA441161",
      "title": "Forge and Cast Researched Magic",
      "description": [
        "Return to the Scroll Forge with the appropriate ink, paper and an echo shard as the Eldritch focus. Select a spell you have actually researched and whose rarity requirement you can meet.",
        "Create its scroll, level it if appropriate and inscribe it into an available book slot. Equip the book, select the spell and test it in a safe place before taking it to a boss.",
        "Read recast, range and targeting information carefully. Eldritch is a school with its own requirements and scaling, not a guarantee that every spell is the best damage option for every encounter.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 74.0,
      "y": 12.0,
      "tasks": [
