      "hide_until_deps_visible": false,
      "icon": "irons_spellbooks:portal_frame"
    },
    {
      "id": "28A4A5EAE27042C8",
      "title": "Late Game · An Archmage's Loadout",
      "description": [
        "Assemble your finished loadout: an upgraded primary attack, a useful alternate damage school, a defensive response, recovery and practical mobility. Equip your book, armor, staff and Curios in their real slots.",
        "On the same training dummy, compare a single burst cast, a full sustained effect and a repeatable rotation over time. Account for mana consumption and cooldown, not just the largest individual number.",
        "Complete both Iron's major boss routes and one researched Eldritch cast, then identify what you would change for a resistant boss or a dangerous exploration trip. Mastery means adapting the loadout, not collecting every spell at once.",
        "Completion: perform the practice described above, then tick this lesson manually. This is a tutorial acknowledgement, not automatic detection of a cast or upgrade."
      ],
      "x": 54.0,
      "y": 28.0,
